Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 23:02:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 195/244] Allow authentication through query parameters and
 update documentation

Update `ceo-proxy.cjs` to support `_token` query parameter for authentication in both `hasValidBearerToken` and `authGateway` functions. Also updates JS script versions in HTML files and modifies documentation in `IG-COMMANDS.md` and `SKILL.md` to reflect the new authentication method.

